{%- comment -%}
  A message written in the app, with [bold] and [highlight] tags, as safe HTML. The text is escaped first and only these four fixed tags are
  turned into markup, so nothing else in it can become HTML. The script's own reader (parseRich) does the same for what it writes later.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{- text | escape | replace: '[bold]', '<strong>' | replace: '[/bold]', '</strong>' | replace: '[highlight]', '<span class="sc__countdown">' | replace: '[/highlight]', '</span>' -}}
